    "title": "pandas.Period.second — pandas 2.1.4 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.Period.second#\n\n- Period.second#\n- Get the second component of the Period. \n  - Returns:\n    - int\n    - The second of the Period (ranges from 0 to 59).\n See also \n  - `Period.hour`\n  - Get the hour component of the Period.\n  - `Period.minute`\n  - Get the minute component of the Period.\n Examples >>> p = pd.Period(\"2018-03-11 13:03:12.050000\") >>> p.second 12",
